inline_comments.body:
@orozery agreed on keeping failed promotions so timeouts stay visible.
Would it make sense to add a `result` label (`success`/`failure`) to split the histogram by outcome?
This would let dashboards read success latency without failures skewing it (instant errors pull it down, timeouts push it up), and read failure/timeout latency on its own.
